_refine_special_details
;
Standard uncertainties from the inverse of the least-squares normal matrix at the final values, multiplied by
chi^2^ = S/(N - P) = 2.0655 over all the points used (Prince, 2004, eq. 6.4.3); those of derived quantities
(positions of a mode phase, distances, angles, the volume) propagated through the full covariance. Values
fixed by symmetry or by a constraint carry none. su's rounded up, the IUCr's 2-19 rule (Schwarzenbach et al.,
1995).
;
